{%- comment -%} SHOKOGI Foil Retreat Panama — PART 2 (after the equipment animation): what's included, what to bring & rental, who it's for, FAQ, closer. Surf Camp design. {%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'sk.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<style>@media(max-width:760px){.skp .sec{content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 560px}}
/* What to bring & gear rental: structured cards */
.skp .band .bt .blead{font-size:14.5px;color:#4c4b47;line-height:1.75;margin:10px 0 0}
.skp .brgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:26px;align-items:stretch}
.skp .brcard{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:24px 26px}
.skp .brcard .dur{margin-bottom:16px}
.skp .brlist{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:14px}
.skp .brlist li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:20px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start}
.skp .brlist .bi{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#f3f1ec;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px}
.skp .brlist b{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:.02em}
.skp .brlist em{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);font-style:normal;line-height:1.5;margin-top:1px}
.skp .brcard.rent{border:1.5px solid var(--pink);box-shadow:0 10px 34px rgba(244,110,149,.14);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.skp .brcard.rent .dur{color:var(--pink)}
.skp .rprice{font-family:var(--font-heading-family,"Barlow Condensed",sans-serif);font-size:44px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;color:var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:9px;margin:2px 0 2px}
.skp .rprice small{font-family:var(--font-body-family,"Figtree",sans-serif);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.skp .rdesc{font-size:13.5px;color:#52514d;line-height:1.6;margin:8px 0 16px}
.skp .rinc{list-style:none;padding:16px 0 0;margin:auto 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;gap:10px}
.skp .rinc li{position:relative;padding-left:24px;font-size:13px;color:#4a4945;line-height:1.5}
.skp .rinc li:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:3px;top:6px;width:8px;height:4px;border-left:1.8px solid var(--pink);border-bottom:1.8px solid var(--pink);transform:rotate(-45deg)}
@media(max-width:760px){.skp .band .bt .kicker{text-align:center}.skp .band .bt .blead{text-align:center}.skp .brgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}}
/* Who should attend: requirements card + approval steps */
.skp .reqcard{max-width:640px;margin:28px auto 0;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:26px 30px}
.skp .reqcard .dur{margin-bottom:16px;text-align:center}
.skp .reqlist{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:13px}
.skp .reqlist li{position:relative;padding-left:30px;font-size:14.5px;color:#4c4b47;line-height:1.55}
.skp .reqlist li:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:4px;top:7px;width:11px;height:6px;border-left:2.2px solid var(--pink);border-bottom:2.2px solid var(--pink);transform:rotate(-45deg)}
.skp .applyhead{text-align:center;margin:40px 0 0}
.skp .apply-cta{text-align:center;margin-top:24px}
@media(max-width:760px){.skp .reqcard{padding:22px 20px}}</style>
<div class="skp">
  <!-- WHAT'S INCLUDED -->
  <div class="sec tint"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker" style="text-align:center">05 &middot; What&rsquo;s Included</div>
    <h2>What&rsquo;s Included in Your Foil Retreat</h2>
    <div class="cards4">
      <div class="ccard">
        <svg class="cico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7"/><path d="M5 10v10h14V10"/><path d="M9 20v-6h6v6"/></svg>
        <div class="dur">Accommodation &amp; Transportation</div>
        <ul><li>Transportation from Panama City to Playa Venao and return</li><li>7 nights at Playa Venao Resort in comfortable rooms</li><li>Daily breakfast and dinner at the resort</li></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ccard">
        <svg class="cico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 17c3 0 4-2 7-2s4 2 7 2 4-2 4-2"/><path d="M14 5a2.2 2.2 0 1 1-4 1"/><path d="M11 7l-2 6"/></svg>
        <div class="dur">Foil Tow-In Sessions</div>
        <ul><li>Up to 12 jet ski tow-in sessions (2 per day)</li><li>Jet ski drivers experienced in foil towing</li><li>Full tow-in foil setup provided</li><li>Safety briefings and session planning each day</li></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ccard">
        <svg class="cico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 7l1.5-2h5L16 7"/><circle cx="12" cy="13.5" r="3.2"/></svg>
        <div class="dur">Professional Filming &amp; Photography</div>
        <ul><li>Professional drone photography and filming</li><li>Daily drone filming during sessions</li><li>All drone footage delivered</li><li>All professional photos delivered</li></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ccard">
        <svg class="cico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3c4 3 5 10 2 18-1 2-3 2-4 0C7 13 8 6 12 3z"/><path d="M12 7v9"/></svg>
        <div class="dur">Bonus Amenities</div>
        <ul><li>Free use of surfboards at Shokogi</li><li>Access to Playa Venao Resort facilities</li><li>Local knowledge and wave forecasting</li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <!-- WHAT TO BRING & GEAR RENTAL -->
  <div class="sec"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="band rev">
      {%- if section.settings.bring_image -%}<img src="{{ section.settings.bring_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="Foil gear in Playa Venao" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
      <div class="bt">
        <div class="kicker">06 &middot; What to Bring</div>
        <h2>What to Bring &amp; Gear Rental</h2>
        <p class="blead">Your sessions, stay, breakfast and dinner, filming, and jet&nbsp;ski support are all covered. Here&rsquo;s the short list to arrange yourself &mdash; and the complete foil setup you can rent on site.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="brgrid">
      <div class="brcard">
        <div class="dur">Not included &mdash; plan ahead</div>
        <ul class="brlist">
          <li><span class="bi">&times;</span><div><b>Foil equipment</b><em>Board, foil, helmet &amp; impact vest &mdash; bring your own or rent</em></div></li>
          <li><span class="bi">&times;</span><div><b>Lunch</b><em>Restaurants within walking distance</em></div></li>
          <li><span class="bi">&times;</span><div><b>Travel insurance</b><em>Highly recommended</em></div></li>
          <li><span class="bi">&times;</span><div><b>Flights</b><em>To Panama City</em></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="brcard rent">
        <div class="dur">Foil gear rental</div>
        <div class="rprice">$100<small>per day</small></div>
        <p class="rdesc">A complete foil setup with a foil board included &mdash; ready for tow-in wave riding.</p>
        <ul class="rinc">
          <li>High-performance tow-in equipment</li>
          <li>Suitable for wave riding</li>
          <li>Reserve your gear when booking</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <!-- WHO SHOULD ATTEND -->
  <div class="sec tint"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="band">
      {%- if section.settings.who_image -%}<img src="{{ section.settings.who_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="Jet ski tow-in foiling in Playa Venao" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
      <div class="bt">
        <div class="kicker">07 &middot; Who It&rsquo;s For</div>
        <h2>Who Should Attend This Foil Tow-In Retreat?</h2>
        <p class="blead">This retreat is built for experienced foilers moving into wave riding. It&rsquo;s a fit if you recognize yourself below &mdash; and every rider is approved in advance so the group rides at one level.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="reqcard">
      <div class="dur">You&rsquo;re ready if</div>
      <ul class="reqlist">
        <li>You can confidently fly a hydrofoil behind jet ski, boat, or wing</li>
        <li>You&rsquo;re comfortable with tow-in basics &mdash; getting up, maintaining flight, releasing rope</li>
        <li>You want to transition from flat water to wave riding</li>
        <li>You can handle intermediate waves (chest-high and above)</li>
        <li>You want video analysis to accelerate progression</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="applyhead">
      <div class="kicker">how to apply</div>
      <h2>Approval Before You Book</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n">1</div>
        <h3>Send Your Videos</h3>
        <p>Email your foil riding clips to <a href="mailto:shokogipanama@gmail.com">shokogipanama@gmail.com</a> showing your current ability.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n">2</div>
        <h3>We Review</h3>
        <p>We confirm you&rsquo;re at the right level, so every participant rides similar conditions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n">3</div>
        <h3>Book Your Spot</h3>
        <p>Just 4 places per retreat. Once you&rsquo;re approved, reserve your place in Playa Venao.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="apply-cta"><a href="mailto:shokogipanama@gmail.com?subject=Foil%20Retreat%20Panama%20Application" class="btn pink">Email Your Videos</a></div>
  </div></div>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <div class="sec tint"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker" style="text-align:center">08 &middot; FAQ</div>
    <h2>FAQ</h2>
    <div class="faq" style="margin-top:22px">
      <details open><summary>What skill level do I need?</summary><div class="ans">You must already be comfortable flying a hydrofoil behind a jet ski, boat, or wing. This retreat is for intermediate to advanced foilers transitioning to wave riding.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How does the video approval process work?</summary><div class="ans">Before booking, submit foil riding videos showing your current ability to <a href="mailto:shokogipanama@gmail.com">shokogipanama@gmail.com</a>. This ensures all participants have similar skill levels for the best group experience.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Should I bring my own foil equipment or rent?</summary><div class="ans">Foil equipment (board, foil, helmet, impact vest) isn&rsquo;t included &mdash; bring your own or rent. A complete foil setup is available for $100 per day and includes a foil board; reserve your gear when booking.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How many hours on the water each day?</summary><div class="ans">Up to two tow-in sessions per day, each 1.5&ndash;2 hours on the water &mdash; up to 12 sessions across the retreat.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Are flights to Panama included?</summary><div class="ans">No &mdash; flights to Panama City are not included. Round-trip transportation from Panama City to Playa Venao is included.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How big are the waves at Playa Venao?</summary><div class="ans">Playa Venao receives consistent Pacific swells year-round and is never flat. For this retreat you should be comfortable in intermediate waves &mdash; chest-high and above.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Is this suitable for beginners?</summary><div class="ans">No &mdash; this retreat requires existing tow-in experience. If you&rsquo;re new to foiling, start with our beginner foil lessons to build foundational skills first.</div></details>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <!-- CLOSER -->
  <div class="sec" id="retreat-book"><div class="wrap closer">
    <h2>Ready to ride empty, perfect waves?</h2>
    <p>Just 4 spots per retreat. Email us your foil videos to apply and book your place in Playa Venao.</p>
    <a href="mailto:shokogipanama@gmail.com?subject=Foil%20Retreat%20Panama%20Booking" class="btn pink">Email Us to Book</a>
  </div></div>
</div>

